          "wanderer"
        ],
        "IdentityIds": null,
        "IsFemale": null,
        "IsClanLeader": null,
        "SkillMin": null
      },
      "Content": "佣兵看一面旗是否值得追随，不只看颜色，还看饷银是否足额、伤者是否被抛弃。亮帜团的名声若能换来下一份好契约，每个老兵都有理由维护它。"
    },
    {
      "Priority": 0,
      "When": {
        "HeroIds": null,
        "Cultures": null,
        "KingdomIds": null,
        "SettlementIds": null,
        "Roles": [
